#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:5
msgid "構造相転移"
msgstr "Structural Phase Transitions"

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:7
msgid ""
"BaTiO₃ の結晶相の順序と転移温度を、`機械学習原子間ポテンシャル <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/mlip.html>`__\\ でどこまで再現できるでしょうか。\\ Quloud の GPU "
"で分子動力学（MD）による昇温計算を行い、Ti の局所変位と格子定数から相を判定しました。"
msgstr ""
"How well can `machine-learning interatomic potentials <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/mlip.html>`__ \\  reproduce the phase sequence and "
"transition temperatures of BaTiO₃? \\  We ran molecular dynamics (MD) "
"heating simulations on Quloud GPUs and identified the phases from local "
"displacements of Ti and lattice constants."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:10
msgid ""
"UMA-S と SevenNet では、実験と同じ **菱面体晶（R）→ 斜方晶（O）→ 正方晶（T）→ 立方晶（C）** "
"の順に相が現れました。\\ CHGNet では最低温から斜方晶で、菱面体晶は確認できませんでした。\\ 3 "
"モデルとも、正方晶から立方晶に変わる温度は、実験値の 393 K を 400 K 以上上回りました。"
msgstr ""
"UMA-S and SevenNet produced the same phase sequence as the experiment: "
"**rhombohedral (R) → orthorhombic (O) → tetragonal (T) → cubic (C)**. \\"
"  CHGNet gave the orthorhombic phase from the lowest temperature, and we "
"did not observe the rhombohedral phase. \\  In all three models, the "
"tetragonal-to-cubic transition temperature exceeded the experimental "
"value of 393 K by at least 400 K."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:17
msgid "Quloud GPU で得た転移温度"
msgstr "Transition Temperatures Obtained on Quloud GPUs"

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:19
msgid ""
"UMA-S（FairChem の UMA モデル、タスク ``omat``）、SevenNet（7net-ompa）、CHGNet "
"で、圧力を制御しながら温度を上げる NPT 昇温計算を行いました（アンサンブルは技術ノートの\\ `NVE・NVT・NPTで固定する量 "
"<https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/ensembles.html#statistical-"
"ensembles>`__）。\\ 3 モデルともセルサイズは 8 × 8 × 8（2560 原子）、昇温速度は 10 K/ps としました。"
msgstr ""
"With UMA-S (the FairChem UMA model, task ``omat``), SevenNet (7net-ompa),"
" and CHGNet, we ran NPT heating simulations, raising the temperature "
"while controlling pressure (for the ensembles, see \\  `quantities held "
"fixed in NVE, NVT, and NPT <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/ensembles.html#statistical-ensembles>`__ in the "
"Technical Notes). \\  For all three models, we set the cell size to 8 × 8"
" × 8 (2560 atoms) and the heating rate to 10 K/ps."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:22
msgid "昇温軌跡から読み取った転移温度と実験値（K）"
msgstr ""
"Transition temperatures from the heating trajectories and experimental "
"values (K)"

