#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:198
msgid "補足：昇温速度と融解"
msgstr "Supplement: Heating Rate and Melting"

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:200
msgid ""
"立方晶からさらに温度を上げるときは、結晶相の判定とは別に、近接原子の並び方を表す\\ `結合配向秩序パラメータ <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/rdf.html#bond-orientational-order>`__ "
":math:`q_6` を使って、融解に伴う結晶秩序の低下を追えます :sup:`[2]`。\\ この図の 2 "
"本の軌跡では、:math:`q_6` が大きく低下する温度が昇温速度によって変わりました。\\ 見かけの融解温度は、25 K/ps で 1749 "
"K、100 K/ps で 1818 K でした。\\ "
"転移温度を実験と照合する際は、ポテンシャルに加えて、昇温速度による平衡化への影響を考慮する必要があります。"
msgstr ""
"When heating beyond the cubic phase, one can track the loss of "
"crystalline order upon melting separately from identifying the "
"crystalline phases, using the \\  `bond orientational order parameter "
"<https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/rdf.html#bond-orientational-"
"order>`__ :math:`q_6`, which measures how neighboring atoms are arranged "
":sup:`[2]`. \\  In the two trajectories shown, the temperature at which "
":math:`q_6` dropped sharply depended on the heating rate. \\  The "
"apparent melting temperatures were 1749 K at 25 K/ps and 1818 K at 100 "
"K/ps. \\  Comparing transition temperatures with experiment requires "
"accounting for both the potential and the effect of heating rate on "
"equilibration."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:205
msgid "25 K/ps では 1749 K、100 K/ps では 1818 K 付近で結合配向秩序が低下します。"
msgstr ""
"Bond orientational order decreases near 1749 K at 25 K/ps and near 1818 K"
" at 100 K/ps."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:210
msgid "昇温中の :math:`q_6`。一点鎖線は各軌跡での見かけの融解温度、黒の破線は実験値の 1893 K :sup:`[2]`。"
msgstr ""
":math:`q_6` during heating. Dash-dotted lines mark the apparent melting "
"temperature in each trajectory, and the black dashed line marks the "
"experimental value of 1893 K :sup:`[2]`."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:213
msgid "補足：急冷後に残る局所構造"
msgstr "Supplement: Local Structure Remaining After Quenching"

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:215
msgid ""
"液相から急冷したアモルファス BaTiO₃ では、長距離の結晶秩序が失われた後も、Ti の周りに O が配位する局所構造が残ります。\\ "
"部分動径分布関数（RDF） :math:`g(r)` は、原子の組み合わせごとに距離 :math:`r` "
"の分布を表します（定義と、別の計算と比べるときにそろえる条件は技術ノートの\\ `動径分布関数と局所構造 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/rdf.html>`__）。\\ 図では Ti–O "
"の鋭い第一ピークが残る一方、遠距離には結晶に特徴的な鋭い周期ピークが見られません。"
msgstr ""
"In amorphous BaTiO₃ quenched from the liquid, the local structure in "
"which O atoms coordinate Ti persists after long-range crystalline order "
"is lost. \\  The partial radial distribution function (RDF) :math:`g(r)` "
"describes the distribution of distances :math:`r` for each type of atom "
"pair (for the definition and which conditions to match when comparing "
"calculations, see \\  `radial distribution function and local structure "
"<https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/rdf.html>`__ in the Technical "
"Notes). \\  The sharp first peak for Ti–O persists in the figure, whereas"
" the sharp periodic peaks characteristic of a crystal are absent at "
"longer distances."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:219
msgid "急冷後の 6 種類の原子対の動径分布。Ti–O 対の第一ピークが鋭いです。"
msgstr ""
"Radial distributions for six types of atom pairs after quenching. The "
"first peak for Ti–O is sharp."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:224
msgid "アモルファス BaTiO₃ の部分動径分布関数。Ba–Ba、Ba–Ti、Ba–O、Ti–Ti、Ti–O、O–O を示します。"
msgstr ""
"Partial radial distribution functions of amorphous BaTiO₃. The panels "
"show Ba–Ba, Ba–Ti, Ba–O, Ti–Ti, Ti–O, and O–O."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:226
msgid ""
"Ti–Ti の RDF を、隣接する TiO₆ "
"八面体が頂点・辺・面のどれを共有するかで分けると、八面体どうしのつながり方が分かります（技術ノートの\\ `配位多面体のつながり <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/rdf.html#polyhedral-connectivity>`__）。\\"
" 図の主ピークは頂点共有（凡例の「apex sharing」）に対応し、その短距離側に辺共有のピークがあります。面共有の寄与は小さいです。\\ "
"急冷後のガラスには TiO₆ の局所配位が残り、頂点共有と辺共有が混在します。\\ "
"周期的な頂点共有のネットワークを持つ結晶とは、八面体のつながり方と長距離秩序が異なります。"
msgstr ""
"Separating the Ti–Ti RDF by whether neighboring TiO₆ octahedra share a "
"corner, edge, or face shows how the octahedra are connected (see \\  "
"`connectivity of coordination polyhedra <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/rdf.html#polyhedral-connectivity>`__ in the Technical"
" Notes). \\  The main peak corresponds to corner sharing (\"apex "
"sharing\" in the figure), with an edge-sharing peak at shorter distances."
" The contribution from face sharing is small. \\  The quenched glass "
"retains local TiO₆ coordination and contains both corner-sharing and "
"edge-sharing octahedra. \\  Its octahedral connectivity and long-range "
"order differ from those of the crystal, which has a periodic corner-"
"sharing network."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:231
msgid "Ti–Ti の動径分布の主ピークは頂点共有、短距離側のピークは辺共有に対応します。"
msgstr ""
"The main peak of the Ti–Ti radial distribution corresponds to corner "
"sharing, and the peak at shorter distances corresponds to edge sharing."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:236
msgid "アモルファス BaTiO₃ の Ti–Ti 動径分布と、TiO₆ 八面体の接続の種類ごとの寄与。"
msgstr ""
"Ti–Ti radial distribution in amorphous BaTiO₃ and contributions from each"
" type of TiO₆ octahedral connectivity."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:239
msgid "まとめ"
msgstr "Summary"

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:241
msgid ""
":doc:`安定基底状態 <stability>` の 0 K の静的計算では、FairChem の UMA-S 系列を含む全手法で R "
"相のエネルギーが最も低くなりました。\\ 今回の昇温 MD では、UMA-S と SevenNet が実験と同じ R → O → T → C "
"の順に相転移しました。CHGNet の昇温軌跡では R 相を確認できませんでした。"
msgstr ""
"In the static 0 K calculations in :doc:`Stable Ground State <stability>`,"
" the R phase had the lowest energy for every method, including the "
"FairChem UMA-S series. \\  In these MD heating simulations, the phase "
"transitions with UMA-S and SevenNet followed the experimental sequence R "
"→ O → T → C. We did not observe the R phase in the CHGNet heating "
"trajectory."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:244
msgid ""
"8 × 8 × 8 セルでは、3 モデルとも T→C の転移温度が実験値を 400 K 以上上回りました。\\ O→T と T→C "
"の転移温度は、3 モデルとも 5 × 5 × 5 セルより 8 × 8 × 8 セルの方が実験値から離れました。\\ "
"平衡での転移温度を評価するには、昇温速度、セルサイズと保持時間に対する収束、加熱と冷却による差を確かめる必要があります。"
msgstr ""
"In the 8 × 8 × 8 cell, all three models gave T→C transition temperatures "
"at least 400 K above the experimental value. \\  For all three models, "
"the O→T and T→C transition temperatures were farther from the "
"experimental values in the 8 × 8 × 8 cell than in the 5 × 5 × 5 cell. \\"
"  Estimating equilibrium transition temperatures requires checking the "
"heating rate, convergence with cell size and hold time, and differences "
"between heating and cooling."

#: ../../BaTiO3/phase_transition.rst:248
msgid ""
"CHGNet は 0 K では R 相のエネルギーが最も低いのに、昇温軌跡には R 相が現れませんでした。\\ このように 0 K "
"のエネルギー順位と昇温時に現れる相は一致するとは限らないため、モデルの検証では、0 K "
"のエネルギー順位、昇温時の相の順序、転移温度をそれぞれ確かめます。"
msgstr ""
"Although CHGNet gave the R phase the lowest energy at 0 K, the R phase "
"did not appear in its heating trajectory. \\  Thus the energy ordering at"
" 0 K does not necessarily agree with the phases that appear during "
"heating. Model validation should check the 0 K energy ordering, the phase"
" sequence during heating, and the transition temperatures separately."

